--- !u!114 &2096792302
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2096792300}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ba364b9abdf854daf84ea15792ab620d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CoinRush.Intro.StoryController
  storyCamera: {fileID: 990404320}
  slides:
  - title: The Island of Aurum
    body: 'Above the clouds drifts Aurum, an island built on gold. At its heart glows
      the Golden Portal, powered by a thousand coins: the only road home for every
      traveller.'
    shot: {fileID: 281861175}
    accent: {r: 1, g: 0.835, b: 0.29, a: 1}
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8e2bb699bb7834279b5aeb0d79a8f06d, type: 3}
  - title: The Orc King's Raid
    body: Then came the Orc King. Greedy for treasure, he tore the portal apart.
      Its coins burst across the sky like fireworks, and Aurum's light went out.
    shot: {fileID: 1017506631}
    accent: {r: 1, g: 0.435, b: 0.38, a: 1}
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 481ff74ca54c34a55ba73fa91179bd1e, type: 3}
  - title: Three Shattered Worlds
    body: 'The gold rained down on three wild worlds: a sunny meadow, scorching desert
      ruins and a frozen night. His hogs and orc brutes now guard every coin.'
    shot: {fileID: 1520406570}
    accent: {r: 0.431, g: 0.784, b: 1, a: 1}
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1836bf503c5914986bd389b392e44bd7, type: 3}
  - title: Five Unlikely Heroes
    body: An explorer, a sprinter, an acrobat, a strongman and a spy. Different strengths,
      one mission. Pick the hero whose style matches yours.
